  m_text: 'Administration Time

    Self-paced

    Directions

    Say, Complete
    what I say. For example, ice is . . . (cold). Present the test items.

    Scoring

    Score
    2 points if the target response or a reasonable alternative response is given
    (e.g., Sugar is . . . fattening). Score 1 point for a phonemic paraphasia or
    off-target alternative responses (e.g., Grass is . . . brown). Score 0 points
    for an unreasonable response (e.g., Grass is . . . cold).'
