    - target: {fileID: 3425945157351240501, guid: 6efcba846aeb7ae458fcae52f9233420, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Welcome to Nurse Town: Root Cause Analysis Simulation\n\nIn this simulation,
        you will investigate a critical incident in a healthcare setting. Your objective
        is to conduct interviews, analyze the root cause, and assess the results
        to improve patient safety. Follow the steps below to complete your investigation.\nHow
        to Play:\n\n    Learn About the Background\n        Begin by reviewing the
        incident report to understand the situation.\n\n    Conduct Interviews\n       
        Speak with different healthcare professionals involved in the incident.\n       
        You must gather all relevant information before proceeding.\n\n    Complete
        the Interview Process\n        Ensure all key individuals (e.g., Primary
        Nurse, Code Team, Anesthesiologist) have been interviewed.\n        If any
        interviews are incomplete, you must go back and conduct them before moving
        forward.\n\n    Upload Your Root Cause Analysis (RCA)\n        Once all interviews
        are complete, upload your findings.\n\n    Assess the Results\n        Review
        the analysis to determine the contributing factors and possible solutions.\n\n   
        Evaluation\n        Your performance will be assessed through formative and
        summative evaluations to gauge your understanding and decision-making."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
